# Send only what the image build needs. Everything else (virtual environments,
# node_modules, .env files, tests, docs, editor and CI config) stays out of the
# build context.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE.md
!smithsonian_mcp/

# Never send compiled artifacts, even from inside the package directory.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
